{"beat_id": "S020_B116", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "It copied that.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S020_B025 — Recorded action", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "staging": "After an eligible completed ordinary action, the Warden records it and returns a weaker functional analogue using its own body/emitter rather than copying actor choreography."}},
